<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib25.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Proceedings of the 31st ACM SIGKDD Conference on Knowledge
Discovery and Data Mining V. 2</em>, 5106–5116.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib26" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Yang et al. (2025)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Yang, J.; Jiang, D.; He, L.; Siu, S.; Zhang, Y.; Liao, D.; Li, Z.; Zeng, H.;
Jia, Y.; Wang, H.; et al. 2025.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">StructEval: Benchmarking LLMs’ Capabilities to Generate Structural
Outputs.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib26.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2505.20139</em>.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib27" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhou et al. (2023)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Zhou, J.; Lu, T.; Mishra, S.; Brahma, S.; Basu, S.; Luan, Y.; Zhou, D.; and
Hou, L. 2023.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Instruction-Following Evaluation for Large Language Models.

</span>
