</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib28" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhou, Song, and
Zanette (2025)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Zhou, Z.; Song, Y.; and Zanette, A. 2025.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Accelerating Unbiased LLM Evaluation via Synthetic Feedback.

</span>
