¯¯¯¯¯¯¯}
¯¯¯¯¯¯¯],
¯¯¯¯¯¯¯(Omission of some content.)
¯¯¯¯¯¯}
¯¯¯¯¯
</pre>
<p id="A3.SSx2.p1.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SSx2.p1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model Output</span></p><pre id="A3.SSx2.p1.8" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">
¯¯¯¯¯¯{
¯¯¯¯¯¯¯(Omission of some content.)
¯¯¯¯¯¯¯"Ratings": [
¯¯¯¯¯¯¯{
¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯"Source": "IMDb",
¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯"Score": 8.2
¯¯¯¯¯¯¯},
